{"name":"Mat Dazzle Rose","hex":"#ff48d0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"mat","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Matlatzinca."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A flat piece of coarse material used for wiping one’s feet, or as a decorative or protective floor covering.","A small flat piece of material used to protect a surface from anything hot or rough; a coaster."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mat"},{"term":"dazzle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To confuse or overpower the sight of (someone or something, such as a sensor) by means of excessive brightness.","To render incapable of thinking clearly; to overwhelm with showiness or brilliance."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A light of dazzling brilliancy.","Showy brilliance that may stop a person from thinking clearly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dazzle"},{"term":"rose","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A shrub of the genus Rosa, with red, pink, white or yellow flowers.","A flower of the rose plant."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make rose-colored; to redden or flush.","To perfume, as with roses."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rose"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mat","blocks":[{"text":"A mat is a hard or soft floor covering that generally is placed on a floor or other flat surface. Mats serve a range of purposes including:"},{"items":["serving to clean items passed over it, such as a doormat, which removes dirt from the soles of shoes","protecting that which is above the mat, such as a wrestling or gymnastics mat, or an anti-vibration mat","protecting that which is beneath the mat, such as a place mat"]}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Welcome_doormat.JPG/330px-Welcome_doormat.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mat","wikidata":"Q1136834"},{"title":"Rose"